description=CleanUI replaces the default inventory, loot, and context UI with a cleaner, faster, and more compact layout for Project Zomboid Build 42. <LINE> This is the Build 42.19+ version, reviewed through Build 42.20.1 while keeping Build 42.19 compatibility. <LINE> Includes safer context menus, MP container guards, ESC/loot-panel visibility protection, optional weight column support, Equipment UI compatibility, clickable column headers, column auto-fit, PNG sort arrows, AutoLoot/AutoDrop compatibility, and a larger resize handle. Also includes B42.20+ config saving, locked-panel item interaction fixes, Weight column persistence, startup resize guards, and safer modded context-menu transfer actions.
